{
	"Name": "Apache - Bitsadmin User Agent Detected",
	"Description": "Detects inbound requests carrying the Microsoft BITS user agent, indicating potential use of BITSAdmin as a LOLBin download or C2 channel. Original Sigma rules distinguish IP vs. TLD targeting, but destination fields are unavailable in reverse-proxy logs; this rule fires on BITS UA presence alone.",
